-- The module checks 2974 passed, 0 failed.
-- K3, second atom (2026-11-21): quotation as operations of the machine, the paper's third group
-- ("the operations by which the checker, itself a term, inspects values") in miniature. A quoted
-- body is a value (nkv-q); quote at a depth meeting a closure sets a new variable numbered by that
